cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SurveyNCD: Survey-Weighted Analysis of Self-Reported Health Indicators"
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Design-based analysis of self-reported health indicators from complex population
  surveys (WHO STEPS, DHS, MICS): multimorbidity scoring, prevalence, concentration
  index, anthropometric categorisation, mapping, and exploratory survey-weighted
  gradient boosting with SHAP.
authors:
